      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this function gets called if either MUX_USB_ENABLED or MUX_DP_ENABLED is set. The function \u0027set_mux\u0027 as currently written will always connect the aux_n/p lines to the sbu_1/2 lines. The only variable being which direction based on polarity. This absolutely breaks a desired use case of CCD mode. I believe that set_mux needs to have an additional parameter \u0027enabled\u0027 so that it can connect aux \u003c-\u003e sbu as needed in DP mode or disconnect them if only MUX_USB_ENABLED is set.",
